          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pts should be addressed directly w/ a nonthreatening question to confirm if intimate partner abuse has occurred "
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "- "
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "bold"
             }
            ],
            "text": "pt’s right to accept or refuse help"
           },
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎supporting the pt = utmost importance: express empathy, acknowledge the struggle, thank pt for their trust → rapport → pt makes autonomous decisions"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎offering assistance (\"I'd like to offer any help I'm able to\" / \"I want to give you resources that might help your situation\") opens the topic of resources; empathy + assistance lets pts know they can move forward w/ any action plan when ready"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎offer referral to discuss safety + mental health services"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎ask whether a safety plan is in place: preparing a place to go, a signal to alert someone to call 911, a kit w/ essentials in case they need to leave suddenly"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎assess immediate risk, document thoroughly; social work referral"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎hospital admission for safety ⍉appropriate (could escalate IPV if partner discovers why; ⍉a long-term solution)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎calling police/reporting: could escalate violence + worsen situation if pt ⍉willing to leave or press charges; mandatory reporting when IPV involves a person w/ a disability, older adult, or child, or when weapons involved (most states mandate reporting injuries caused by weapons)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎written visit summaries for pts who reported IPV: do ⍉include any written material or resources about IPV"
           }
          ]
